msgid "Program control"
msgstr "程序控制"

msgid "The first card of each input should be:"
msgstr "每个输入的第一张卡片应为："

msgid ""
"where *text* is arbitrary. If file 1 is restarted, *text* must always be the"
" same. The effect of this card is to reset all program counters, etc. If the"
" ``***`` card is omitted, *text* assumes its default value, which is all "
"blank."
msgstr ""
"其中 *text* 是任意的。如果文件 1 被重启，\\ *text* 必须始终保持相同。此卡片的作用是重置所有程序计数器等。如果省略 ``***`` "
"卡片，\\ *text* 将采用其默认值，即全部为空白。"

msgid "The end of the input is signaled by either an end of file, or a"
msgstr "输入的结束由文件结束符或一张"

msgid "card. All input following the ``---`` card is ignored."
msgstr "卡片发出信号。\\ ``---`` 卡片之后的所有输入都将被忽略。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, a job can be stopped at at some place by inserting an "
"``EXIT`` card. This could also be in the middle of a ``DO`` loop or an "
"``IF`` block. If in such a case the ``---`` card would be used, an error "
"would result, since the ``ENDDO`` or ``ENDIF`` cards would not be found."
msgstr ""
"或者，可以通过插入一个 ``EXIT`` 卡片在某个位置停止作业。这也可以在 ``DO`` 循环或 ``IF`` 块的中间进行。如果在这种情况下使用 "
"``---`` 卡片，将会导致错误，因为找不到 ``ENDDO`` 或 ``ENDIF`` 卡片。"

msgid "Restarting a job (RESTART)"
msgstr "重启作业 (RESTART)"

msgid ""
"The :math:`r_i` specify which files are restarted. These files must have "
"been allocated before using ``FILE`` cards. There are two possible formats "
"for the :math:`r_i`:"
msgstr ":math:`r_i` 指定要重启哪些文件。这些文件必须事先使用 ``FILE`` 卡片分配。\\ :math:`r_i` 有两种可能的格式："

msgid ""
"**a) :math:`0 < r_i < 10`:** Restart file :math:`r_i` and restore all "
"information."
msgstr "**a) :math:`0 < r_i < 10`:** 重启文件 :math:`r_i` 并恢复所有信息。"

msgid ""
"**b) :math:`r_i=name.nr`:** Restart file :math:`nr` but truncate before "
"record *name*."
msgstr "**b) :math:`r_i=name.nr`:** 重启文件 :math:`nr`\\ ，但在记录 *name* 之前截断。"

msgid ""
"If all :math:`r_i=0`, then all permanent files are restarted. However, if at"
" least one :math:`r_i` is not equal to zero, only the specified files are "
"restarted."
msgstr "如果所有 :math:`r_i=0`\\ ，则重启所有永久文件。但是，如果至少有一个 :math:`r_i` 不等于零，则仅重启指定的文件。"

msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid ""
"``RESTART;`` will restart all permanent files allocated with ``FILE`` cards "
"(default)"
msgstr "``RESTART;`` 将重启所有通过 ``FILE`` 卡片分配的永久文件（默认）"

msgid "``RESTART,1;`` will restart file 1 only"
msgstr "``RESTART,1;`` 将仅重启文件 1"

msgid "``RESTART,2;`` will restart file 2 only"
msgstr "``RESTART,2;`` 将仅重启文件 2"

msgid "``RESTART,1,2,3;`` will restart files 1-3"
msgstr "``RESTART,1,2,3;`` 将重启文件 1-3"

msgid ""
"``RESTART,2000.1;`` will restart file 1 and truncate before record 2000."
msgstr "``RESTART,2000.1;`` 将重启文件 1 并在记录 2000 之前截断。"

msgid "Including secondary input files (INCLUDE)"
msgstr "包含次级输入文件 (INCLUDE)"

msgid ""
"If the ``ECHO`` option is specified, the included file is echoed to the "
"output in the normal way, but by default its contents are not printed. The "
"included file may itself contain ``INCLUDE`` commands up to a maximum "
"nesting depth of 10."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了 ``ECHO`` 选项，包含的文件会以正常方式回显到输出中，但默认情况下其内容不会被打印。包含的文件本身可以包含 ``INCLUDE`` "
"命令，最大嵌套深度为10。"

msgid ""
"For the name of the *file* and the characters allowed, similar "
"recommendations hold as for the Molpro input file, see "
"https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=quickstart#how_to_run_molpro"
"  . The include file together with a path to it may however be used."
msgstr ""
"对于\\ *文件*\\ 的名称和允许使用的字符，其建议与Molpro输入文件类似，请参阅 "
"https://www.molpro.net/develop/manual/doku.php?id=quickstart#how_to_run_molpro"
" 。不过，可以同时使用包含文件及其路径。"

msgid "Allocating dynamic memory (MEMORY)"
msgstr "分配动态内存 (MEMORY)"

msgid ""
"Sets the limit on dynamic memory to :math:`n` floating point words. For "
"details, see section `memory allocation "
"<general_program_structure.html#memory-allocation>`__."
msgstr ""
"将动态内存限制设置为 :math:`n` 个浮点字。详情请参阅 `内存分配 "
"<general_program_structure.html#memory-allocation>`__ 一节。"

msgid "DO loops (DO/ENDDO)"
msgstr "DO 循环 (DO/ENDDO)"

msgid "``DO`` *variable*\\ ``=``\\ *start, end* [[,]\\ *increment*] [[,]\\ *unit*]"
msgstr "``DO`` *变量*\\ ``=``\\ *起始值, 终止值* [[,]\\ *增量*] [[,]\\ *单位*]"

msgid ""
"where *start, end, increment* may be expressions or variables. The default "
"for *increment* is 1. In contrast to Fortran, these variables can be "
"modified within the loop (to be used with care!). For instance:"
msgstr ""
"其中 *起始值, 终止值, 增量* 可以是表达式或变量。\\ *增量* 的默认值为 1。与 Fortran "
"不同，这些变量可以在循环内被修改（需谨慎使用！）。例如："

msgid ""
"performs the loop for the following values of ``R``: ``1.0, 1.2, 1.4, 1.6, "
"1.8, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0, 4.0, 5.0, 6.0`` Ångstrøm. The same could be achieved as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"对 ``R`` 的以下值执行循环：\\ ``1.0, 1.2, 1.4, 1.6, 1.8, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0, 4.0, 5.0, "
"6.0`` 埃。也可以通过以下方式实现："

msgid ""
"Up to 20 ``DO`` loops may be nested. Each ``DO`` must end with its own "
"``ENDDO``."
msgstr "最多可以嵌套 20 个 ``DO`` 循环。每个 ``DO`` 必须以自己的 ``ENDDO`` 结束。"

msgid ""
"Jumps into ``DO`` loops are possible if the ``DO`` variables are known. This"
" can be useful in restarts, since it allows to continue an interrupted "
"calculation without changing the input (all variables are recovered in a "
"restart)."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``DO`` 变量已知，则可以跳入 ``DO`` "
"循环。这在重启时很有用，因为它允许在不更改输入的情况下继续中断的计算（所有变量在重启时都会恢复）。"

msgid ""
"See `introductory examples <introductory_examples.html#do-loops>`__ for two "
"examples of using do loops."
msgstr "有关使用 DO 循环的两个示例，请参阅 `入门示例 <introductory_examples.html#doloops>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Branching (IF/ELSEIF/ENDIF)"
msgstr "分支（IF/ELSEIF/ENDIF）"

msgid "IF statements"
msgstr "IF 语句"

msgid "``IF (logical expression) THEN statements ENDIF``"
msgstr "``IF (logical expression) THEN statements ENDIF``"

msgid "If only one statement is needed, the one-line form"
msgstr "如果只需要一个语句，可以使用单行形式"

msgid "can be used, except if *statement* is a procedure name."
msgstr "可以使用，除非 *statement* 是过程名。"

msgid ""
"The logical expression may involve logical comparisons of algebraic "
"expressions or of strings. Examples:"
msgstr "逻辑表达式可以涉及代数表达式或字符串的逻辑比较。例如："

msgid "In the previous example the dollar and the quotes are optional:"
msgstr "在前面的例子中，美元符号和引号是可选的："

msgid "GOTO commands"
msgstr "GOTO 命令"

msgid "``GOTO,command,[n],[nrep]``"
msgstr "``GOTO,command,[n],[nrep]``"

msgid ""
"Program control skips to the :math:`|n|`\\ ’th occurrence of *command* "
"(Default: :math:`n=1`). *command* must be a keyword in the first field of an"
" input line. If *n* is positive, the search is forward starting from the "
"current position. If *n* is negative, search starts from the top of the "
"input. The ``GOTO`` command is executed at most *nrep* times. The default "
"for *nrep* is 1 if :math:`n \\lt 0` and infinity otherwise. We recommend "
"that ``GOTO`` commands are never used to construct loops."
msgstr ""
"程序控制跳转到 *command* 的第 :math:`|n|`\\ 次出现（默认值：\\ :math:`n=1`\\ ）。\\ *command* "
"必须是输入行第一个字段中的关键字。如果 *n* 为正数，则从当前位置开始向前搜索。如果 *n* 为负数，则从输入顶部开始搜索。\\ ``GOTO`` "
"命令最多执行 *nrep* 次。\\ *nrep* 的默认值为 1（如果 :math:`n \\lt 0`\\ ），否则为无穷大。我们建议永远不要使用 "
"``GOTO`` 命令来构造循环。"

msgid "Alternatively, one can jump to labels using"
msgstr "或者，可以使用以下方式跳转到标签："

msgid "``GOTO,label``"
msgstr "``GOTO,label``"

msgid ""
"Since labels must be unique, the search starts always from the top of the "
"input. It is required that the *label* ends with a colon."
msgstr "由于标签必须是唯一的，搜索总是从输入顶部开始。要求 *label* 以冒号结尾。"

msgid "Labels (LABEL)"
msgstr "标签（LABEL）"

msgid "``LABEL``"
msgstr "``LABEL``"

msgid ""
"This is a dummy command, sometimes useful in conjunction with ``GOTO``."
msgstr "这是一个虚拟命令，有时与 ``GOTO`` 结合使用很有用。"

msgid "Procedures (PROC/ENDPROC)"
msgstr "过程（PROC/ENDPROC）"

msgid ""
"Procedures can be defined at any place of the input or in ``INCLUDE`` files "
"as follows:"
msgstr "过程可以在输入的任何位置或在 ``INCLUDE`` 文件中定义，如下所示："

msgid "Alternatively, one can use the form"
msgstr "或者，可以使用以下形式"

msgid "``PROC name[=]{statements}``"
msgstr "``PROC name[=]{statements}``"

msgid ""
"In the latter case, it is required that the left curly bracket (:math:`\\{`)"
" appears on the same line as ``PROC``, but *statements* can consist of "
"several lines. If in the subsequent input *name* is found as a command *in "
"the first field* of a line, it is substituted by the *statements*. Example:"
msgstr ""
"在后一种情况下，要求左花括号 (:math:`\\{`) 与 ``PROC`` 出现在同一行，但 *statements* "
"可以包含多行。如果在后续输入中，\\ *name* 作为命令在行的\\ *第一个字段*\\ 中被找到，它将被 *statements* 替换。示例："

msgid "Alternatively, this could be written as"
msgstr "或者，也可以写成"

msgid ""
"Procedures may be nested up to a depth of 10. In the following example "
"``runscf`` is a procedure:"
msgstr "过程可以嵌套，最多可达10层深度。在以下示例中，\\ ``runscf`` 是一个过程："

msgid ""
"Note: Procedure names are substituted only if found in the first field of an"
" input line. Therefore, they must not be used on one-line ``IF`` statements;"
" please use ``IF / ENDIF`` structures instead."
msgstr ""
"注意：过程名仅当在输入行的第一个字段中找到时才会被替换。因此，它们不能用于单行 ``IF`` 语句；请改用 ``IF / ENDIF`` 结构。"

msgid ""
"If as first statement of a procedure ``ECHO`` is specified, the substituted "
"commands of the present and lower level procedures will be printed. If "
"``ECHO`` is specified in the main input file, all subsequent procedures are "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"如果在过程的第一个语句中指定了 ``ECHO``\\ ，则当前及更低层级过程的替换命令将被打印出来。如果在主输入文件中指定了 ``ECHO``\\ "
"，则所有后续过程都会被打印。"

msgid ""
"Certain important input data can be passed to the program using variables. "
"For instance, occupancy patterns, symmetries, number of electrons, and "
"multiplicity can be defined in this way (see section `special variables "
"<variables.html#special-variables>`__ for more details). This allows a quite"
" general use of procedures. Procedures can also be used in geometry "
"optimizations or extrapolations, for example:"
msgstr ""
"某些重要的输入数据可以通过变量传递给程序。例如，占据模式、对称性、电子数和多重度可以这种方式定义（详见 `特殊变量 "
"<variables.html#special-variables>`__ 章节）。这使得过程的使用非常通用。过程也可用于几何优化或外推，例如："

msgid "Default Procedures"
msgstr "默认过程"

msgid ""
"Many standard calculations can be used with the ``run`` command, see "
"`Simplified input <introductory_examples.html#simplified-input>`__. They "
"allow to write simple inputs in the most compact way."
msgstr ""
"许多标准计算可以使用 ``run`` 命令完成，参见 `简化输入 "
"<introductory_examples.html#simplifiedinput>`__\\ 。它们允许以最紧凑的方式编写简单的输入。"

msgid ""
"Further predefined procedures are available in ``lib/include/procedures``:"
msgstr "在 ``lib/include/procedures`` 中提供了更多预定义过程："

msgid "A line"
msgstr "一行"

msgid ""
"is necessary to include these procedures. Some procedures use variables "
"SYMMETRY, SPIN, STATE, NELEC to define state symmetries, spins, and charges,"
" respectively. For example, the procedure ``runmrci`` can be used for a "
"calculation of a vertical ionization potential of H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"是包含这些过程所必需的。某些过程使用变量 SYMMETRY、SPIN、STATE、NELEC 来分别定义态对称性、自旋和电荷。例如，过程 "
"``runmrci`` 可用于计算 H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O 的垂直电离势，如下所示："

msgid ""
"Note: At present, all variables are *global*, i.e., variables are commonly "
"known to all procedures and all variables defined in procedures will be "
"subsequently known outside the procedures as well. The reason is that "
"procedures are included into the internal input deck at the beginning of the"
" job and not at execution time; for the same reason, variable substitution "
"of procedure names is not possible, e.g. one cannot use constructs like"
msgstr ""
"注意：目前，所有变量都是\\ *全局*\\ "
"的，即变量对所有过程都是共知的，并且在过程中定义的所有变量随后在过程外部也将被知晓。原因是过程在作业开始时被包含到内部输入卡组中，而不是在执行时；出于同样的原因，过程名的变量替换是不可能的，例如，不能使用像这样的结构"

msgid "Text cards (TEXT)"
msgstr "文本卡片（TEXT）"

msgid ""
"will just print *xxxxxx* in the output. If the text contains variables which"
" are preceded by a dollar ($), these are replaced by their actual values, "
"e.g."
msgstr "将仅在输出中打印 *xxxxxx*\\ 。如果文本包含以美元符号（$）为前缀的变量，这些变量将被其实际值替换，例如"

msgid "will print"
msgstr "将打印"

msgid "``Results for R=2.1``"
msgstr "``Results for R=2.1``"

msgid "Checking the program status (STATUS)"
msgstr "检查程序状态（STATUS）"

msgid ""
"This command checks and prints the status of the specified program steps. "
"*commands* may be a list of commands for wavefunction calculations "
"previously executed in the current job. If no *command* or ``LAST`` is "
"specified, the status of the last step is checked. If ``ALL`` is given, all "
"program steps are checked."
msgstr ""
"此命令检查并打印指定程序步骤的状态。\\ *commands* 可以是当前作业中先前执行的波函数计算命令列表。如果未指定 *command* 或 "
"``LAST``\\ ，则检查最后一步的状态。如果指定了 ``ALL``\\ ，则检查所有程序步骤。"

msgid ""
"If ``CRASH`` or ``STOP`` is given, the program will crash or stop, "
"respectively, if the status was not o.k. (``STOP`` is default). If "
"``IGNORE`` is given, any bad status is ignored. If ``CLEAR`` is specified, "
"all status information for the checked program steps is erased, so there "
"will be no crash at subsequent status checks."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了 ``CRASH`` 或 ``STOP``\\ ，程序将在状态不正常时分别崩溃或停止（默认为 ``STOP``\\ ）。如果指定了 "
"``IGNORE``\\ ，则忽略任何不良状态。如果指定了 ``CLEAR``\\ "
"，则清除所检查程序步骤的所有状态信息，因此在后续状态检查时不会发生崩溃。"

msgid ""
"``STATUS,HF,CRASH;`` will check the status of the last ``HF-SCF`` step and "
"crash if it was not o.k. (i.e. no convergence). ``CRASH`` is useful to avoid"
" that the next program in a chain is executed."
msgstr ""
"``STATUS,HF,CRASH;`` 将检查最后一个 ``HF-SCF`` 步骤的状态，如果状态不正常（即未收敛），则崩溃。\\ ``CRASH``"
" 有助于避免链中的下一个程序被执行。"

msgid ""
"``STATUS,MULTI,CI,STOP;`` will check the status of the most previous "
"``MULTI`` and ``CI`` steps and stop if something did not converge."
msgstr ""
"``STATUS,MULTI,CI,STOP;`` 将检查最近一次 ``MULTI`` 和 ``CI`` 步骤的状态，如果某些内容未收敛，则停止。"

msgid "Note that the status variables are not recovered in a restart."
msgstr "请注意，状态变量在重启时不会恢复。"

msgid "By default, the program automatically does the following checks:"
msgstr "默认情况下，程序会自动执行以下检查："

msgid ""
"1.) If an orbital optimization did not converge, and the resulting orbitals "
"are used in a subsequent correlation calculation, an error will result. This"
" error exit can be avoided using the ``IGNORE_ERROR`` option on the "
"``ORBITAL`` directive."
msgstr ""
"1.) 如果轨道优化未收敛，并且所得的轨道被用于后续的相关计算中，将会导致错误。可以通过在 ``ORBITAL`` 指令上使用 "
"``IGNORE_ERROR`` 选项来避免此错误退出。"

msgid ""
"2.) If a ``CCSD|QCI|BCC|LMPn`` calculation did not converge, further program"
" steps which depend on the solution (e.g, Triples, CPHF, EOM) will not be "
"done and an error will result. This can be avoided using the ``NOCHECK`` "
"option on the command line."
msgstr ""
"2.) 如果 ``CCSD|QCI|BCC|LMPn`` "
"计算未收敛，依赖于该解的后续程序步骤（例如，Triples、CPHF、EOM）将不会执行，并会导致错误。这可以通过在命令行上使用 ``NOCHECK``"
" 选项来避免。"

msgid ""
"3.) In geometry optimizations or frequency calculations no convergence will "
"lead to immediate error exits."
msgstr "3.) 在几何优化或频率计算中，不收敛将导致立即错误退出。"

msgid "Global Thresholds (GTHRESH)"
msgstr "全局阈值 (GTHRESH)"

msgid "[command:gthresh]"
msgstr "[command:gthresh]"

msgid ""
"A number of global thresholds can be set using the ``GTHRESH`` command "
"outside the individual programs (the first letter ``G`` is optional, but "
"should be used to avoid confusion with program specific ``THRESH`` cards). "
"The syntax is"
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``GTHRESH`` 命令在单个程序之外设置多个全局阈值（第一个字母 ``G`` 是可选的，但建议使用以避免与程序特定的 "
"``THRESH`` 卡片混淆）。语法为"

msgid "*key* can be one of the following."
msgstr "*key* 可以是以下之一。"

msgid "``ZERO`` Numerical zero (default 1.d-12)"
msgstr "``ZERO`` 数值零（默认值 1.d-12）"

msgid ""
"``ONEINT`` Threshold for one-electron integrals (default 1.d-12, but not "
"used at present)"
msgstr "``ONEINT`` 单电子积分阈值（默认值 1.d-12，但当前未使用）"

msgid ""
"``TWOINT`` Threshold for the neglect of two-electron integrals (default "
"1.d-12)"
msgstr "``TWOINT`` 忽略双电子积分的阈值（默认值 1.d-12）"

msgid ""
"``PREFAC`` Threshold for test of prefactor in ``TWOINT`` (default 1.d-14)"
msgstr "``PREFAC`` ``TWOINT`` 中前置因子测试的阈值（默认值 1.d-14）"

msgid "``LOCALI`` Threshold for orbital localization (default 1.d-8)"
msgstr "``LOCALI`` 轨道定域化阈值（默认值 1.d-8）"

msgid ""
"``EORDER`` Threshold for reordering of orbital after localization (default "
"1.d-4)"
msgstr "``EORDER`` 定域化后轨道重新排序的阈值（默认值 1.d-4）"

msgid "``ENERGY`` Convergence threshold for energy (default 1.d-6)"
msgstr "``ENERGY`` 能量的收敛阈值（默认值 1.d-6）"

msgid ""
"``GRADIENT`` Convergence threshold for orbital gradient in ``MCSCF`` "
"(default 1.d-2)"
msgstr "``GRADIENT`` ``MCSCF`` 中轨道梯度的收敛阈值（默认值 1.d-2）"

msgid ""
"``STEP`` Convergence threshold for step length in MCSCF orbital optimization"
" (default 1.d-3)"
msgstr "``STEP`` MCSCF 轨道优化中步长的收敛阈值（默认值 1.d-3）"

msgid ""
"``ORBITAL`` Convergence threshold for orbital optimization in the SCF "
"program (default 1.d-5)."
msgstr "``ORBITAL`` SCF 程序中轨道优化的收敛阈值（默认值 1.d-5）。"

msgid ""
"``CIVEC`` Convergence threshold for CI coefficients in ``MCSCF`` and "
"reference vector in ``CI`` (default 1.-d.5)"
msgstr "``CIVEC`` ``MCSCF`` 中 CI 系数和 ``CI`` 中参考向量的收敛阈值（默认值 1.-d.5）"

msgid ""
"``COEFF`` Convergence threshold for coefficients in ``CI`` and ``CCSD`` "
"(default 1.d-4)"
msgstr "``COEFF`` ``CI`` 和 ``CCSD`` 中系数的收敛阈值（默认值 1.d-4）"

msgid "``PRINTCI`` Threshold for printing CI coefficients (default 0.05)"
msgstr "``PRINTCI`` 打印 CI 系数的阈值（默认值 0.05）"

msgid ""
"``PUNCHCI`` Threshold for punching CI coefficients (default 99 - no punch)"
msgstr "``PUNCHCI`` 穿孔输出 CI 系数的阈值（默认值 99 - 不输出）"

msgid ""
"``SYMTOL`` Threshold for finding symmetry equivalent atoms (default 1.d-6)"
msgstr "``SYMTOL`` 寻找对称性等价原子的阈值（默认值 1.d-6）"

msgid "``GRADTOL`` Threshold for symmetry in gradient (default 1.d-6)."
msgstr "``GRADTOL`` 梯度中对称性的阈值（默认值 1.d-6）。"

msgid ""
"``THROVL`` Threshold for smallest allowed eigenvalue of the overlap matrix "
"(default 1.d-8)"
msgstr "``THROVL`` 重叠矩阵最小允许特征值的阈值（默认 1.d-8）"

msgid ""
"``THRDLOV`` Threshold for removing linear dependent basis functions and "
"orbitals"
msgstr "``THRDLOV`` 移除线性相关基函数和轨道的阈值"

msgid "``THRORTH`` Threshold for orthonormality check (default 1.d-8)"
msgstr "``THRORTH`` 正交归一性检查的阈值（默认 1.d-8）"

msgid ""
"``THRPRINT`` Threshold for printing orbitals (thrprint=-1 : column-wise; "
"thrprint=0 : row-wise, as in Molpro2015 and earlier versions ; thrprint "
":math:`>0`: print only coefficients that are larger than the threshold "
"together with labels (default: thrprint=0.25)"
msgstr ""
"``THRPRINT`` 打印轨道的阈值（thrprint=-1：按列；thrprint=0：按行，与 Molpro2015 "
"及更早版本相同；thrprint :math:`>0`\\ ：仅打印大于该阈值的系数及标签（默认：thrprint=0.25））"

msgid "Global Print Options (GPRINT/NOGPRINT)"
msgstr "全局打印选项（GPRINT/NOGPRINT）"

msgid "[command:gprint]"
msgstr "[command:gprint]"

msgid ""
"Global print options can be set using the ``GPRINT`` command outside the "
"individual programs (the first letter ``G`` is optional, but should be used "
"to avoid confusion with program specific ``PRINT`` cards). The syntax is"
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``GPRINT`` 命令在各个程序之外设置全局打印选项（首字母 ``G`` 是可选的，但建议使用以避免与程序特定的 ``PRINT`` "
"卡片混淆）。语法为"

msgid ""
"Normally, *value* can be omitted, but values :math:`\\gt 0` may be used for "
"debugging purposes, giving more information in some cases. The default is no"
" print for all options, except for ``DISTANCE``, ``ANGLES`` (default=0), and"
" ``VARIABLE``. ``NOGPRINT``,\\ *key* is equivalent to ``PRINT``,\\ *key*\\ "
"``=-1``. *key* can be one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"通常，\\ *value* 可以省略，但值 :math:`\\gt 0` 可用于调试目的，在某些情况下提供更多信息。默认情况下，除 "
"``DISTANCE``\\ 、\\ ``ANGLES``\\ （默认=0）和 ``VARIABLE`` 外，所有选项均不打印。\\ "
"``NOGPRINT``,\\ *key* 等同于 ``PRINT``,\\ *key*\\ ``=-1``\\ 。\\ *key* 可以是以下之一："

msgid "``BASIS`` Print basis information"
msgstr "``BASIS`` 打印基组信息"

msgid "``DISTANCE`` Print bond distances (default)"
msgstr "``DISTANCE`` 打印键长（默认）"

msgid ""
"``ANGLES`` Print bond angle information (default). If :math:`\\gt` 0, "
"dihedral angles are also printed."
msgstr "``ANGLES`` 打印键角信息（默认）。如果 :math:`\\gt` 0，则同时打印二面角。"

msgid "``ORBITAL`` Print orbitals in ``SCF`` and ``MCSCF``"
msgstr "``ORBITAL`` 在 ``SCF`` 和 ``MCSCF`` 中打印轨道"

msgid "``ORBEN`` Print orbital energies in ``SCF``"
msgstr "``ORBEN`` 在 ``SCF`` 中打印轨道能量"

msgid "``CIVECTOR`` Print ``CI`` vector in ``MCSCF``"
msgstr "``CIVECTOR`` 在 ``MCSCF`` 中打印 ``CI`` 向量"

msgid "``PAIRS`` Print pair list in ``CI, CCSD``"
msgstr "``PAIRS`` 在 ``CI, CCSD`` 中打印对列表"

msgid "``CS`` Print information for singles in ``CI, CCSD``"
msgstr "``CS`` 在 ``CI, CCSD`` 中打印单激发信息"

msgid "``CP`` Print information for pairs in ``CI, CCSD``"
msgstr "``CP`` 在 ``CI, CCSD`` 中打印对激发信息"

msgid "``REF`` Print reference CSFs and their coefficients in ``CI``"
msgstr "``REF`` 在 ``CI`` 中打印参考组态态函数及其系数"

msgid "``PSPACE`` Print p-space configurations"
msgstr "``PSPACE`` 打印 P 空间组态"

msgid "``MICRO`` Print micro-iterations in ``MCSCF`` and ``CI``"
msgstr "``MICRO`` 在 ``MCSCF`` 和 ``CI`` 中打印微迭代信息"

msgid "``CPU`` Print detailed CPU information"
msgstr "``CPU`` 打印详细的 CPU 信息"

msgid "``IO`` Print detailed I/O information"
msgstr "``IO`` 打印详细的 I/O 信息"

msgid ""
"``VARIABLE`` Print variables each time they are set or changed (default)."
msgstr "``VARIABLE`` 每次变量被设置或更改时打印变量信息（默认）。"

